  "own_original_text": "Executive Order 12440 of September 8, 1983\nPresident’s Commission on Industrial Competitiveness\nBy the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and law s of the  \nUnited States of A m erica, including the Federal, Advisory Committee A ct, as  \namended (5 U.S.C. App. I), and in order to increase the membership of the  \nPresident’s Commission on Industrial Competitiveness, it is hereby ordered  \nthat the second sentence of Section 1(a) of Executive Order No. 12428 of June  \n28,1983 is hereby amended to provide as follows:\n“The Commission shall be composed of no more than thirty members appoint­\ned or designated by the President.”.\nTHE W H ITE HOUSE, \nSeptember 8, 1983.\n[FR Doc. 63-24956 \nFiled 9-9-83; 10:46 am]",
